# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the gallery's$
# fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes: the simulated$
# system only records each step it would apply, and the record$
# is shown when play ends.$
# Each workflow plays its dry-run sequence, where it has one,$
# else its first.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
